# Compiled to requirements.lock with --no-deps, then installed with --no-deps. See README.
#
# PyMuPDF 2.1 declares hard dependencies on its layout and LLM add-ons (pymupdf4llm, pymupdf-layout,
# onnxruntime, numpy, networkx and others). PaperForge uses none of them, pymupdf imports and runs
# without them, and bundling them would add hundreds of megabytes. The worker test suite runs against
# exactly this set, so a change that starts needing one of them fails there.

# Runtime
PyMuPDF==2.1
Pillow==13.0.0

